license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  BRSDK is a deterministic, high-frequency telemetry framework and Python SDK
  designed to bridge the Simulation-to-Real (Sim2Real) transfer gap in autonomous
  vehicle engineering, reinforcement learning, and vehicle dynamics within
  BeamNG.drive and BeamNG.tech.
keywords:
  - BeamNG
  - Sim2Real
  - Autonomous Driving
  - Reinforcement Learning
  - Vehicle Dynamics
  - Telemetry
  - Simulation
